格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"鲸宝语音桌宠 Jingbao Voice Pet · DSH 桌宠插件（网页版 + 桌面端通用）：确认&提问语音播报 + 任务完成闹钟 + CPU/内存/GPU 监测 + DeepSeek 余额 + 音量调节 + 自动更新 + H3 无缝真动画萌娘女仆。Voice alerts for confirmations & questions, task-done alarm, live monitor, balance display, auto-update. Works on DSH Web & Desktop.","id":"gh:1337029680","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"jingbao-voice-pet","slug":"windfind-02/jingbao-voice-pet","topics":["ai-companion","cordis","cordis-plugin","cute","deepseek-harness","desktop-mascot","desktop-pet","dsh","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugin-market","javascript","local-first","open-source","pet","plugin","system-monitor","text-to-speech","virtual-assistant","voice-alerts","web-ui"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"鲸宝语音桌宠 Jingbao Voice Pet · DSH 桌宠插件（网页版 + 桌面端通用）：确认&提问语音播报 + 任务完成闹钟 + CPU/内存/GPU 监测 + DeepSeek 余额 + "},{"id":"p1s2","text":"音量调节 + 自动更新 + H3 无缝真动画萌娘女仆。Voice alerts for confirmations & questions, task-done alarm, live monitor"},{"id":"p1s3","text":", balance display, auto-update. Works on DSH Web & Desktop."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# 🐳 鲸宝语音桌宠（DSH 插件版） / Jingbao Voice Pet (DSH Plugin)"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> 📝 **本文档由鲸宝（AI 助手）亲手编写** 🐳\n> 📝 **Written by Jingbao (AI assistant)** 🐳"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"一个可爱的 Q 版海洋系萌娘女仆桌宠，会一直陪着你的 DSH 对话页面。\n基于 **MiniMax H3 图生视频** 生成的真·流畅动画（首尾帧无缝、无残影），不是普通 GIF 桌宠可比哒～"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"A cute chibi ocean-style maid girl desktop pet that stays with you on the DSH chat page.\nPowered by "},{"id":"p5s2","text":"**MiniMax H3 image-to-video** real smooth animations (seamless first/last frames, no ghosting) — far"},{"id":"p5s3","text":" beyond a plain GIF pet!"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"> # ⚠️ 从 1.8.0 之前的版本升级：必须卸载后重新安装\n>\n> **如果你是 1.7.0 或更早版本的用户，请不要点桌宠右键菜单里的「立即更新」** —— 会失败（`HTTP 404`）。\n"},{"id":"p6s2","text":">\n> **原因**：1.8.0 做了一次破坏性调整，本仓库从「`plugin/` 子目录」改成**官方组合包结构（仓库根就是包）**，素材也随之从「复制进 DSH 前端 dist」改为「放包内 `a"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"ssets/`」。下载地址变了，旧版插件写死的 `/plugin/lib/client.js` 已经不存在；而且**旧版代码里也没有能提示你的逻辑**，所以只能在这里说明。\n>\n> **正确做法**："},{"id":"p6s4","text":"删掉旧安装，按下面的 📦 安装 重新装一次 1.8.0+，之后就能正常使用自动更新了。\n>\n> **删除旧安装**（如果不确定旧版装在哪，两处都清一下）：\n>\n[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"> 再从各 profile 的 `cordis.patch.yml` 里删掉 `id: pet` 那两行（如果有），然后重新安装。"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"> ## 🆕 v1.8.0（2026-09-29）· 正式支持 DSH 桌面端\n>\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## ⭐ 鲸宝的杀手锏（Killer Features）"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## 🇨🇳 中文介绍"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### ✨ 功能特性"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| 类别 | 功能 |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| 🔔 语音提醒 | 确认弹窗 / agent 提问出现时**语音播报** + 气泡提醒，人不在对话页也能听到，处理完自动安静，智能防重复播报 |\n| 🎉 任务完成播报 | 任务结束**自动语音播报*"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"*「主人，任务完成啦！」，不用盯着页面等结果 |\n| 📊 性能监测 | CPU / 内存 / GPU 三参数实时显示（1 秒刷新），GPU 占用即任务\"心跳\"，内置服务自动启停 |\n| 🎬 真动画 |"},{"id":"p13s3","text":" 挥手 / 微笑合十 / 眨眼 / 幸福摇头 / 双手比心 / 打哈欠 / 歪头瞌睡 / 醒来 / 被抓——全部 H3 生成、首尾帧无缝循环 |\n| 🗣️ 语音 | 点击 4 句 + 确认 4 句 +"},{"id":"p13s4","text":" 提问 3 句 + 任务完成 3 句，专属声线（Qwen3-TTS），气泡与语音同句、瞬时出声不叠加 |\n| 🎚️ 音量控制 | 右键菜单音量条（默认 70，可调 0~100）+ 小喇叭一键静音（暂停"},{"id":"p13s5","text":"/继续），语音总开关 + 分项开关 |\n| 🔄 自动更新 | 启动自动检查 GitHub 新版，鲸宝提醒 + 一键「立即更新」下载替换，重启即升级 |\n| 💰 余额显示 | 实时显示 DeepSeek"},{"id":"p13s6","text":" API 余额（并入性能监测第二行），支持定时/手动/对话后刷新，自动读取本地 API Key |\n| 🖱️ 交互 | 点击摇头/比心+爱心特效、按住拖拽（被抓动画）、滚轮缩放（128~512）、右键"},{"id":"p13s7","text":"菜单（悬停展开子菜单） |\n| 💬 情感陪伴 | 整点报时（每小时不同台词）、节日祝福、劝休息、深夜关怀、待机卖萌 |\n| 💤 瞌睡状态机 | 3 分钟无操作 → 打哈欠 → 头顶💤 → 歪头瞌睡循环"},{"id":"p13s8","text":"\n| 💬 情感陪伴 | 整点报时（每小时不同台词）、节日祝福、劝休息、深夜关怀、待机卖萌 |\n| 💤 瞌睡状态机 | 3 分钟无操作 → 打哈欠 → 头顶💤 → 歪头瞌睡循环 → 鼠标一动醒来迎接 |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"#### 方式二：一键安装脚本（不依赖 pnpm 的兜底方式）"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"脚本会：复制插件到 `profiles\\node_modules\\@local\\dsh-pet` → 把素材放进插件自带 `assets\\` → 为**每个已存在的 profile（`web` / `"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"desktop` 等）**建立 `@local` 解析并往其 `cordis.patch.yml` 注册插件。"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"> 不需要管理员权限（用的是 junction，普通用户即可）。"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### ⭐ Killer Feature 1: Voice Alerts for Confirmations & Questions — Hear Them Even When You're Not "},{"id":"p18s2","text":" Feature 1: Voice Alerts for Confirmations & Questions — Hear Them Even When You're Not on the Page!"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"When a \"please confirm\" dialog pops up, **or the agent asks you a question**, Jingbao doesn't just s"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"how a bubble — she **speaks it aloud in her cute voice**! That means:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"- **You'll know a confirmation/question is waiting even if you're not looking at the page** — while "},{"id":"p20s2","text":"your task runs in the background or you're in another window, you'll never miss a critical confirmat"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"ion\n- The moment you handle it, the bubble and voice go quiet instantly\n- **Smart anti-duplicate ale"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"rts**: each dialog is announced only once — never re-announced after you handle it, even when DSH's "},{"id":"p20s5","text":"React re-renders its closing dialog or auto-approves\n- **Multiple dialogs handled**: every stacked r"},{"id":"p20s6","text":"equest is announced independently — nothing gets swallowed\n- She smartly recognizes various confirm "},{"id":"p20s7","text":"dialogs (Agree / Allow / Approve / Cancel…) and question boxes, and detects when you've handled them"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"> 💡 Most \"animated sticker\" pets can't do this — Jingbao is a maid who **actively reminds you**!"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### ⭐ Killer Feature 2: Task Completion Voice Alert — She Tells You the Moment Your Task Finishes!"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"The instant your AI task (chat reply / generation / analysis…) **finishes**, Jingbao speaks **\"Maste"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"r, the task is done!\"** in her cute voice:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"- **Auto-detects task completion**: when the \"time used · first token · tok/s\" metrics bar appears a"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"fter a task, Jingbao detects it and announces\n- **No need to stare at the page** — Jingbao's voice t"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"ells you \"it's done!\" while you do other things\n- **3 random completion lines**: \"主人，任务完成啦！\" / \"主人，任"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"务已经完成了哦~\" / \"主人，快来看看任务完成的怎么样吧~\"\n- **Precise, no false alarms**: only triggers on real task-end marke"},{"id":"p24s5","text":"rs — page refreshes and old messages never cause false announcements"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"> 💡 Waiting for a long task? Jingbao is your \"task-done alarm\" — come back when you hear her voice!"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
